  name: success
  
  request: {
    url: {{host}}/api/v1/petrovis/count
    method: GET
    mode: none
  }
  
  response: {
    headers: {
      access-control-allow-credentials: true
      access-control-allow-headers: Origin, Content-Type, api_key, Content-Length, Accept-Encoding, X-CSRF-Token, Authorization
      access-control-allow-methods: POST, GET, OPTIONS, PATCH, PUT, DELETE, UPDATE
      access-control-allow-origin: *
      access-control-expose-headers: Content-Length
      access-control-max-age: 86400
      cache-control: no-cache
      content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
      date: Wed, 04 Feb 2026 15:07:19 GMT
      content-length: 122
    }
  
    status: {
      code: 200
      text: OK
    }
  
    body: {
      type: json
      content: '''
        {
          "success": true,
          "message": "success count petrovis delegates status",
          "data": {
            "total": 9,
            "paid": 5,
            "pending": 3,
            "cancelled": 1
          }
        }
      '''
    }
  }
}

docs {
  ## Description
  Count total Petrovis delegates aggregated by transaction payment status. Provides statistics on total delegates, paid delegates, pending registrations, and cancelled registrations.

  ## Authentication
  - Bearer token required
  - Role: **Admin only**

  ## Response Structure
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "success count petrovis delegates status",
    "data": {
      "total": 9,
      "paid": 5,
      "pending": 3,
      "cancelled": 1
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Response Fields
  | Field | Type | Description |
  |-------|------|-------------|
  | total | integer | Total number of delegates across all Petrovis registrations |
  | paid | integer | Number of delegates from paid registrations |
  | pending | integer | Number of delegates from pending/unpaid registrations |
  | cancelled | integer | Number of delegates from cancelled registrations |

  ## Error Responses
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|
  | 401 | Unauthorized (missing or invalid token) |
  | 403 | Forbidden (not an admin) |
  | 500 | Failed to count petrovis delegates status |

  ## Business Logic Notes
  - Counts ALL delegates across all registrations (not just registrations)
  - A single registration with 3 delegates counts as 3 delegates
  - Status is derived from the associated Tripay transaction status
  - Categories are mutually exclusive (each delegate counted once)
  - total = paid + pending + cancelled
  - Useful for event planning and capacity management
  - Does not include deleted/cancelled registrations in any count
}
